| Technique                 | Description                                                                 | Example                                                                                   |
|---------------------------|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
| Code Splitting            | Splitting code into smaller chunks for better load performance.               | `import('./module').then((module) => {...});`                                             |
