WebAssembly provides a practical path to performance improvements for server-side applications with compute-intensive workloads. The technology has matured enough for production use while maintaining flexibility across deployment environments. By starting with isolated components and measuring carefully, teams can achieve meaningful performance gains without architectural overhauls.

